35
00:00:50,939 --> 00:00:52,819
But nobody else got a single

36
00:00:52,839 --> 00:00:54,087
dollar richer.

37
00:00:54,107 --> 00:00:55,652
That's what averages do.

38
00:00:55,672 --> 00:00:57,390
A few very rich families

39
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,471
drag the average way up.

40
00:00:59,491 --> 00:01:01,450
So we use the median instead.

41
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:03,204
Line every family up from

42
00:01:03,224 --> 00:01:04,448
