45
00:01:07,413 --> 00:01:09,236
The median American family

46
00:01:09,256 --> 00:01:11,138
is worth about two hundred

47
00:01:11,158 --> 00:01:13,203
sixteen thousand dollars.

48
00:01:13,223 --> 00:01:15,396
Not one point two four million.

49
00:01:15,416 --> 00:01:17,752
Two hundred sixteen thousand.

50
00:01:17,772 --> 00:01:19,504
And that number includes

51
00:01:19,524 --> 00:01:20,349
