56
00:01:24,272 --> 00:01:25,880
Now let's break it down

57
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:26,403
by age,

58
00:01:26,423 --> 00:01:28,146
because comparing yourself

59
00:01:28,166 --> 00:01:29,774
to a sixty-year-old makes

60
00:01:29,794 --> 00:01:30,813
no sense.

61
00:01:30,833 --> 00:01:32,644
Families under thirty-five:

62
00:01:32,664 --> 00:01:34,790
a median net worth of about

63
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:37,211
thirty-three thousand dollars.

64
00:01:37,231 --> 00:01:39,016
Thirty-five to forty-four:

65
00:01:39,036 --> 00:01:41,089
about one hundred fifty-six

66
00:01:41,109 --> 00:01:42,157
thousand.

67
00:01:42,177 --> 00:01:43,867
Forty-five to fifty-four:

68
00:01:43,887 --> 00:01:45,971
about two hundred fifty-four

69
00:01:45,991 --> 00:01:47,028
thousand.

70
00:01:47,048 --> 00:01:48,763
Fifty-five to sixty-four:

71
00:01:48,783 --> 00:01:50,765
about four hundred twelve

72
00:01:50,785 --> 00:01:51,833
thousand.

73
00:01:51,853 --> 00:01:53,611
Sixty-five to seventy-four:

74
00:01:53,631 --> 00:01:55,706
about four hundred thirty-one

75
00:01:55,726 --> 00:01:56,741
thousand.

76
00:01:56,761 --> 00:01:58,658
And seventy-five and older:

77
00:01:58,678 --> 00:02:00,447
about five hundred five

78
00:02:00,467 --> 00:02:01,487
thousand.

79
00:02:01,507 --> 00:02:02,582
Notice the shape.

80
00:02:02,602 --> 00:02:04,169
Wealth is slow at first,

81
00:02:04,189 --> 00:02:06,595
and then it builds for decades.

82
00:02:06,615 --> 00:02:08,372
And if you're under thirty-five

83
