110
00:02:47,336 --> 00:02:47,722
Next,

111
00:02:47,742 --> 00:02:48,527
debt.

112
00:02:48,547 --> 00:02:50,063
About forty-five percent

113
00:02:50,083 --> 00:02:51,939
of families carry a balance

114
00:02:51,959 --> 00:02:53,759
on their credit cards from

115
00:02:53,779 --> 00:02:55,183
month to month.

116
00:02:55,203 --> 00:02:56,381
For those families,

117
00:02:56,401 --> 00:02:58,179
the median balance is about

118
00:02:58,199 --> 00:02:59,868
three thousand one hundred

119
00:02:59,888 --> 00:03:00,759
dollars.

120
00:03:00,779 --> 00:03:02,894
And nearly one in five families

121
00:03:02,914 --> 00:03:04,523
