122
00:03:04,543 --> 00:03:06,377
a loan payment in the past

123
00:03:06,397 --> 00:03:06,714
year.

124
00:03:06,734 --> 00:03:08,343
That's up from about one

125
00:03:08,363 --> 00:03:09,923
in eight in 2022.

126
00:03:09,943 --> 00:03:11,607
So if you're juggling some

127
00:03:11,627 --> 00:03:11,933
debt,

128
00:03:11,953 --> 00:03:13,672
you have a lot of company.

129
00:03:13,692 --> 00:03:14,976
The goal isn't shame.

130
00:03:14,996 --> 00:03:16,680
The goal is a plan.

131
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,204
Then retirement.

132
00:03:18,224 --> 00:03:20,573
Only about fifty-five percent

133
00:03:20,593 --> 00:03:23,230
