186
00:04:33,574 --> 00:04:35,314
Even one month is a real

187
00:04:35,334 --> 00:04:36,111
start.

188
00:04:36,131 --> 00:04:36,526
Three.

189
00:04:36,546 --> 00:04:38,246
Am I investing something

190
00:04:38,266 --> 00:04:39,076
every month?

191
00:04:39,096 --> 00:04:41,254
Even fifty dollars counts.

192
00:04:41,274 --> 00:04:43,024
If you can say yes to those

193
00:04:43,044 --> 00:04:43,378
