199
00:04:50,493 --> 00:04:51,510
you versus you,

200
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:52,716
a year ago.

201
00:04:52,736 --> 00:04:54,372
Write down your net worth

202
00:04:54,392 --> 00:04:54,746
