205
00:04:56,795 --> 00:04:57,790
Is it going up?

206
00:04:57,810 --> 00:04:59,525
That's the whole game.

207
00:04:59,545 --> 00:05:00,908
Let's recap.

208
00:05:00,928 --> 00:05:01,837
Averages lie.

209
00:05:01,857 --> 00:05:03,819
The median family is worth

210
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,678
about two hundred sixteen

211
00:05:05,698 --> 00:05:06,297
thousand,

212
00:05:06,317 --> 00:05:07,750
not a million.

213
00:05:07,770 --> 00:05:08,941
Under thirty-five,

214
00:05:08,961 --> 00:05:11,259
the median is about thirty-three

215
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:11,885
